    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- create a sample web page with clearly defined sections (hero, feature cards, call-to-action)\r\n- add specific data attributes to each section to identify its name and job\r\n- implement JavaScript to detect taps/clicks on these sections\r\n- on tap/click, apply a temporary 'wiggle' animation to the tapped section\r\n- on tap/click, display a nametag next to the section showing its name and job\r\n- ensure the nametag disappears after a short delay or on subsequent tap/click",
